## File 1 — CreateTaskDescription.tsx (mount-effect seed, 1 hunk)
Inserted after the `emit` definition (now :73-83):
```
// Open one empty Description box by default on load so the user can start
// typing without clicking "Add New Box". Fires once on mount; the ref guards
// against the parent-onChange re-render and any StrictMode double-invoke.
const seededRef = React.useRef(false);
